<title>POLAND: NFI HETMAN Q2 NET LOSS AT PLN 3.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>NFI HETMAN Q2 NET LOSS AT PLN 3.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish National Investment Fund (NFI) Hetman's preliminary results for the second quarter of 1997, in millions of zlotys:</p>
<p>					Q2 1997		    Q2 1996</p>
<p>  Net loss			    3.07			 50.98</p>
<p>  Investment portfolio	  435.82			459.34</p>
<p>  Liabilities and reserves     55.34			 10.72</p>
<p>  Net assets			396.80			451.75</p>
<p>  Assets per share (PLN)	 12.79			 12.91</p>
<p>NOTE: The company full name is Narodowy Fundusz Inwestycyjny Hetman SA.  -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
